	"Description": "[size=6]\u00A0 \u00A0 \u00A0 \u00A0 \u00A0 \u00A0 \u00A0 \u00A0 \u00A0 \u00A0 \u00A0 \u00A0 \u00A0 \u00A0 [b][color=#ff0000]请不要二次上传到任何地方\n<br />\u00A0 \u00A0 \u00A0 \u00A0 \u00A0 \u00A0 \u00A0 更不要拿去倒卖盈利(包括所谓的整合辛苦费)\n<br />[/color][/b][/size][size=4]\u00A0 \u00A0 \u00A0 \u00A0 \u00A0 \u00A0 \u00A0 \u00A0 \u00A0 \u00A0 \u00A0 \u00A0 \u00A0 \u00A0 \u00A0 \u00A0 \u00A0 \u00A0 \u00A0 Please do not re upload to any place or pay for purchase.\n<br />[/size][size=3][color=#ff0000]________________________________________________________________________________________________________[/color]\n<br />\n<br />[color=#f4f4f4]7 hairstyles in FS mode You need to install\u00A0 Fashion Sense\u00A0to find these hairs.\n<br />\n<br />Dark: The texture is clearer, but it will turn gray when the hair color is light.\n<br />Light: The texture is lighter, but it becomes blurry when the hair color is darker.\n<br />Color: Pink and gold are two unique hair colors.\n<br />\n<br />The above three files can be used separately, please download them as needed\n<br />\n<br />Please note that the file is divided into two versions: one suitable for more elegant farmer body(MEFB) and the other suitable for other body types. Please download the corresponding file according to your own body type\n<br />\n<br />Due to the unique frame of the more elegant farmer body, different styles have been created for male and female body frames. FS will provide you with hairstyles suitable for this frame based on your character's gender.\n<br />\n<br />[/color][/size]--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n<br />[size=3]FS模式下的7款发型.你需要安装时尚感来找到这些头发..\n<br />\n<br />Dark:纹理更加清晰,但浅发色时会发灰.\n<br />Light:纹理更淡,但深发色时纹理会模糊.\n<br />Color:粉色和金色两种独特发色.\n<br />以上三种文件均可以单独使用,请按需下载.\n<br />\n<br />注意文件分为适用于更优雅的农夫身体(MEFB)和适用于其他体型两个版本,请根据自己使用的体型下载相应文件.\n<br />\n<br />其中因为更优雅的农夫体型独特的框架,已经为男女体型框架做了不同的样式,FS将根据你的角色性别自行为你提供适用于该框架的发型.[/size]",
